OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FShowers will affect windward
OL,6,Fcoasts and spread inland through the
OL,7,Fmorning, with the heaviest and most
OL,8,Ffrequent in the northeast. Conditions
OL,9,Fimprove from the west with sunny
OL,10,Fspells developing, before rain reaches
OL,11,Fthe far northwest later. Breezy, with
OL,12,Fnear-average temperatures.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FRain moves form the northwest
OL,15,Fto the southeast overnight. Some heavy
OL,16,Frain affects western and northern
OL,17,Fareas. Blustery showers follow in the
OL,18,Fnorth and northwest. Generally mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
