OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRain clears southeastern
OL,6,FEngland by early afternoon. Elsewhere,
OL,7,Fsunny spells and showers. Most
OL,8,Ffrequent in the north with strong
OL,9,Fwinds and coastal gales possible.
OL,10,FCooler northwest, near average
OL,11,Fsoutheast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
